'''Axe Cat''' is one of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] and your first proper damage-dealing cat. It is unlocked after clearing [[China (Empire of Cats)|China]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 and costs 0 XP (2,000 in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]) or a [[Cat Capsule|Normal Cat Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] doubles health and attack, and marginally increases backswing. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is available once clearing China from the Empire of Cats chapter and costs 2000 XP to be unlocked/rolled in the Normal Cat Capsule.

